Which pigment gives most plants their green color? [chlorophyll]

Name the two main vascular tissues in flowering plants. {xylem, phloem}

Photosynthesis mainly happens in the [chloroplasts | chloroplast] of plant cells.

What structure anchors most plants in the ground? [roots | root system]

What three things do most seeds need to germinate? {water, oxygen, warmth | heat}
